    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plyte</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Soar, bounce, and conquer in a physics-based journey through breathtaking canyon landscapes.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Plyte, a spherical adventurer on a mission to restore balance to a fractured world. Using precise taps, you'll defy gravity, bounce off ancient rock formations, and navigate a series of stunning levels inspired by the serene yet rugged beauty of the American Southwest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/912816c898fff9241b6c975d245b9ba2.poster.avif?t=1752160361\" width=700 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/912816c898fff9241b6c975d245b9ba2.webm?t=1752160361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/912816c898fff9241b6c975d245b9ba2.mp4?t=1752160361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Physics:</strong> Experience the thrill of precise movement and momentum as you interact with a world shaped by the forces of nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Environments:</strong> Journey through levels that evoke the grandeur of canyons, cliffs, and icy peaks. The higher you ascend, the more breathtaking the views\u2014and challenges\u2014become.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Scoring System:</strong> Earn points by conserving taps and achieving level objectives. Unlock the next challenge by meeting or exceeding the minimum score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Floating Boosts:</strong> Collect floating elements to replenish your taps and discover strategic opportunities to push your score higher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Adventure:</strong> Reclaim the golden laurel wreaths, each brimming with ancient wisdom, as you strive to restore a world on the brink of collapse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/254fca795fad648227a185186114f866.poster.avif?t=1752160361\" width=700 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/254fca795fad648227a185186114f866.webm?t=1752160361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/254fca795fad648227a185186114f866.mp4?t=1752160361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Give Plyte the Boost!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/f35361ea1c6c4e04cd3af4d79f004f0b.poster.avif?t=1752160361\" width=700 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/f35361ea1c6c4e04cd3af4d79f004f0b.webm?t=1752160361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/f35361ea1c6c4e04cd3af4d79f004f0b.mp4?t=1752160361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Master the art of tapping to boost Plyte upwards - each tap counts\u2014use them wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bump the Bumpers!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/ee4a2e0c0790f8922bfbaf10b626ac6f.poster.avif?t=1752160361\" width=750 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/ee4a2e0c0790f8922bfbaf10b626ac6f.webm?t=1752160361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/ee4a2e0c0790f8922bfbaf10b626ac6f.mp4?t=1752160361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness horizontal momentum by bouncing off natural bumpers - its all\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Sky's the Limit!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/8a57c9f1246c6853a080734ff4b15d4d.poster.avif?t=1752160361\" width=700 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/8a57c9f1246c6853a080734ff4b15d4d.webm?t=1752160361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/8a57c9f1246c6853a080734ff4b15d4d.mp4?t=1752160361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In many levels, there is no upper boundary - fly as high as you like, gain falling speed to ricochet off the rock bumpers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/644d6441bf2261856ca0a3d1ddfc8131.poster.avif?t=1752160361\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/644d6441bf2261856ca0a3d1ddfc8131.webm?t=1752160361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/644d6441bf2261856ca0a3d1ddfc8131.mp4?t=1752160361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You'll Love Plyte</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its minimalist controls, immersive environments, and satisfying physics-based gameplay, <i>Plyte</i> is a captivating journey that combines casual action with thoughtful strategy. Whether you're aiming for the high score or just enjoying the serene vistas, every moment in <i>Plyte</i> is a delight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the challenge and reclaim the wreaths? The adventure begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plyte</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Soar, bounce, and conquer in a physics-based journey through breathtaking canyon landscapes.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Plyte, a spherical adventurer on a mission to restore balance to a fractured world. Using precise taps, you'll defy gravity, bounce off ancient rock formations, and navigate a series of stunning levels inspired by the serene yet rugged beauty of the American Southwest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/912816c898fff9241b6c975d245b9ba2.poster.avif?t=1752160361\" width=700 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/912816c898fff9241b6c975d245b9ba2.webm?t=1752160361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/912816c898fff9241b6c975d245b9ba2.mp4?t=1752160361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Physics:</strong> Experience the thrill of precise movement and momentum as you interact with a world shaped by the forces of nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Environments:</strong> Journey through levels that evoke the grandeur of canyons, cliffs, and icy peaks. The higher you ascend, the more breathtaking the views\u2014and challenges\u2014become.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Scoring System:</strong> Earn points by conserving taps and achieving level objectives. Unlock the next challenge by meeting or exceeding the minimum score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Floating Boosts:</strong> Collect floating elements to replenish your taps and discover strategic opportunities to push your score higher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Adventure:</strong> Reclaim the golden laurel wreaths, each brimming with ancient wisdom, as you strive to restore a world on the brink of collapse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/254fca795fad648227a185186114f866.poster.avif?t=1752160361\" width=700 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/254fca795fad648227a185186114f866.webm?t=1752160361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/254fca795fad648227a185186114f866.mp4?t=1752160361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Give Plyte the Boost!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/f35361ea1c6c4e04cd3af4d79f004f0b.poster.avif?t=1752160361\" width=700 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/f35361ea1c6c4e04cd3af4d79f004f0b.webm?t=1752160361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029070/extras/f35361ea1c6c4e04cd3af4d79f004f0b.mp4?t=1752160361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Master the art of tapping to boost Plyte upwards - each tap counts\u2014use them wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bump the Bumpers!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"b